          "content": {
            "en": {
              "h1": "Future-Proofing Businesses with Human-First Transformation, Value-First AI",
              "subheading": "We orchestrate AI, data, and digital transformation around your P&L—delivering ROI-as-Service in as less as 90 days with human-first, compliant execution across DACH and UAE.",
              "highlights": [
                "ROI-as-a-Service for DACH & UAE enterprises",
                "90-Day measurable outcomes",
                "Human-first, governance-by-design",
                "Networked delivery across EMEA and beyond"
