              "h2": "Led by Cross-Regional Experience",
              "body": "Bagmi Sahoo, founder of HumanAIze, has spent 25+ years leading digital and AI initiatives across Europe and the Middle East, including Fortune 500s.\n\nHer work has delivered +30% efficiency, −28% IT costs, and +25% customer satisfaction across EMEA, NAFTA, APAC and GCC—bridging German precision with UAE agility.",
              "cta": {
